#set error,exit
#
#@ HEADER
#@ NAME         dis.diffev.mac
#@
#@ KEYWORD      refinement, generic, nanoparticle
#@
#@ DESCRIPTION  Main macro for the refinement of ellipsoidal
#@ DESCRIPTION  ZnSe nanoparticles with growth type stacking faults.
#@ DESCRIPTION  In this set of macros the structure is refined versus
#@ DESCRIPTION  the PDF
#@ DESCRIPTION  Prior to using this macro all refinement variables 
#@ DESCRIPTION  have to be defined. Best to be used from macro
#@ DESCRIPTION  "diffev_best" or as interface macro from the main
#@ DESCRIPTION  DIFFEV refinement macro.
#@
#@ PARAMETER    $0, 0
#@
#@ USAGE        @dis.diffev.mac
#@
#@ END
#
############################################################
#
variable integer, indiv  ! Dummy variable for the local repetitions
!
branch kuplot  ! Step sideways into KUPLOT
   reset       ! Ensure there are no data sets
exit           ! Back to DISCUS section
#
@global.mac    ! Definitions of directories etc
@get_model.mac ! Obtain refinement model, REF_NINDIV might be changed
#
do indiv = 1, REF_NINDIV      ! Loop over all individual repetitions
  @discus.znse.mac            ! Main structure building
enddo
#
branch   kuplot    !Switch sideways into KUPLOT
   @kup.diffev.mac ., REF_KID  ! contains a final exit
#
exit    ! Finish DISCUS, back to DIFFEV
